abstract: >-
  A browser application that compares a learner's hand movement and singing
  voice with a teacher's video recording. The learner moves one hand along an
  invisible ladder of the nine degrees from Ni to Pa'. Hand contours are
  compared by correlation and mean absolute difference after removing their
  medians; the voice is compared with the teacher's in moria of the 72-moria
  Chrysanthine scale. Hand tracking uses MediaPipe Hands and pitch detection
  uses YIN. Everything runs in the browser; nothing is installed and no
  recording leaves the device.
